# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Clinical-content firewall
#
# This repository releases a TOKENISED dataset. Two classes of content must
# never enter its history — not even in a private repo, because history is what
# becomes public on release:
#
#   1. Patient data of any kind. Record numbers, national identifiers,
#      telephone numbers, anything under Patient_Records.
#   2. The deployed system's governed clinical vocabulary. The paper states that
#      the set is withheld; anything below would falsify that sentence.
#
# The scans that enforce this are in analysis/. Run them before every push.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Un-tokenised results — the released copy lives in results/, this pattern
# catches an accidental copy of the raw ones.
02_Results/
*_raw.jsonl

# The live system and anything importing it
admissibility.py
tag_normalize.py
VR6AI4_*.py

# Local identifier fixtures
*_keyfile.txt
.hdkps_*

# Credentials
*.key
*api_key*
.env

# Backups and scratch
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.log
*.ckpt
__pycache__/
_preview_*.png
